  <item>
    <title>17.【⛵️☕️2024年终总结💅🥗】</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6773fd091e823e72d344d42e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6773fd091e823e72d344d42e</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 31 Dec 2024 15:18:15 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>hey 朋友们~还有几个小时2024年就要结束了，这两天大家是不是也忙于做年终总结或者开年会？今天，我们以轻松的视角同样也做了一份年终总结！其中包括年度旅行目的地推荐、年度美食分享、年度咖啡店、年度爱用好物分享等内容。如果你看烦了公司里制式的表格和年终总结ppt，听烦了年会上老套的总结内容和未来展望，那我们相信本期内容一定能够给你带来一份放松和欢乐！快按下播放键吧！朋友们明年见~</span></p><span></span><p><span>【总结如下】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="55">00:00:55</a>:【旅行目的地】：澳门 &amp; 甲米</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="337">00:05:37</a>: 根本吃不够的澳门惊艳蛋挞</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="679">00:11:19</a>: &nbsp;甲米：是什么让卡司双人组在甲米产生分歧？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="815">00:13:35</a>:【年度歌曲专栏】郑秀文 &amp; Billy Ward</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1566">00:26:06</a>:【年度影视作品观后感】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1846">00:30:46</a>:【增添生活情趣之年度好物】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2210">00:36:50</a>:【年度美食推荐】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2375">00:39:35</a>: 昆明街边羊肉米线、炸鸡、西双版纳的凉拌店不容错过！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2714">00:45:14</a>:【年度咖啡店】香料 DIRTY和山顶咖啡店&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3018">00:50:18</a>:【年度大事件】最佳嘉宾入围的有...</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3433">00:57:13</a>:【年度感悟】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3720">01:02:00</a>:【年度遗憾】</span></p>]]></description>
