  <item>
    <title>🎄16.抄作业 | 圣诞晚餐菜谱推荐</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6768412915a5fd520eaf2517</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6768412915a5fd520eaf2517</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 22 Dec 2024 21:57:46 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>马上要到圣诞节了，你是否也曾经遇到餐厅难预定、有最低消费等小问题？如果你也是，那么不妨约上你最好的朋友，自己在家开火做顿晚餐，一起Have fun吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目卡司双人组已经为你准备好了圣诞晚餐菜谱，整整一桌子的菜都是我们亲手烹饪过，保证色香味俱全！快来抄作业！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">00:02:00</a>:平安夜你收到苹果了吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="243">00:04:03</a>:圣诞老人会把礼物放在你的袜子里？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="364">00:06:04</a>:圣诞节晚餐菜单，快来抄作业</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="514">00:08:34</a>:Babygun拿手好菜：匈牙利炖鸡 美味指数⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="685">00:11:25</a>:Babygun美味炖鸡的小秘密</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="853">00:14:13</a>:T老板的烤串大拼盘 趣味指数 ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1030">00:17:10</a>:Babygun快手菜推荐：盐焗大虾 烹饪难度 ⭐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1200">00:20:00</a>:T老板倾囊相授：圣诞烤鸡 风味指数⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1372">00:22:52</a>:烤鸡奇妙风味的秘密：烟熏风味与多种填充食材的碰撞</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1608">00:26:48</a>:酸奶沙拉 解腻指数⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1750">00:29:10</a>:圣诞节怎么少得了花环，那就交给沙拉吧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1887">00:31:27</a>:平日里都很忙碌的朋友们，就让我们在圣诞节好好聚一聚吧</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lutl8JmFunGZKr0CymKjVj3Xdtea.m4a" length="67365529" type="audio/mp4"/>
