  <item>
    <title>14.云旅行 | 打卡宝藏县城：通海</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6755bfd717cd5416ad759ab1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6755bfd717cd5416ad759ab1</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 08 Dec 2024 16:09:24 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>hi~朋友们，非常抱歉在周末即将结束的时候上新。因为本期聊天内容非常适合照抄周末昆明周边游之——通海县！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主讲BBgun老师将为各位倾情安利他从小吃到大的坊间美食，以及手把手教大家如何在他的家乡通海县逍遥度日。</span></p><span></span><p><span>下个周末，还不走起来？！SHOWNOTES更精彩，文末有彩蛋！</span></p><span></span><p><span>MC:BBGUN、T老板</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="123">00:02:03</a>:秀山：历史与文化的宝藏之地，自然与人文的完美结合</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="243">00:04:03</a>:探寻历史文化之旅：通海县的古建筑与自然景观</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="369">00:06:09</a>:自然与人文交织的宝藏之地：云南通海的美丽风景与民风民俗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="553">00:09:13</a>:探寻通海县的文化瑰宝：四阁楼、红墙和传统文化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="738">00:12:18</a>:探寻美味：南街餐厅与北街回族餐厅的牛肉面与肉串之旅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="922">00:15:22</a>:口感纷呈：米线、耳块和烧麦的美妙结合</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1108">00:18:28</a>:口感鲜美，地瓜粉制作的肉酱，让你爱上耳块的味道！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1291">00:21:31</a>:品尝稀豆粉与耳快的奇妙组合，感受耳块与牛肉汤的美味碰撞！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1476">00:24:36</a>:通海县城的美食记忆：豆末汤圆、夜市和童年的回忆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1661">00:27:41</a>:云南风味：探索抛糕、年糕和炸羊月炸的独特口感！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1846">00:30:46</a>:探寻云南美食之旅：通海特色料理与夜生活推荐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2032">00:33:52</a>:一个小时二十分钟四十二元，到达有古建筑的酒店，夜生活丰富！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl0CUIY5FKOF-EP3fnsex2Qmr0uS.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvRu443Agbtd_VAYun7ypLn5cwPP.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs3rcuNt23_lNk4BvSDmflTDNhg3.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FumI7jmfYgqxajCkjM5SiSnK4E8y.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg4xPGDaM8V6Bv8wfJomIW5fN5y4.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrR0Etm1RezB2AcedI7Roa6ar1SW.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkzE-x70pIa95nwaMZa8mSMVZh-e.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
